00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:48.909
Is that true?

00:01:48.909 --> 00:01:49.909
Was she misquoted?

00:01:49.909 --> 00:01:51.640
Was she taken out of context?

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:57.840
