00:03:51.109 --> 00:03:52.109
I don't know.

00:03:52.109 --> 00:03:57.010
And while we're at it, maybe there's context
that makes Lindsey Graham's comment less ridiculous,

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:59.250
although I can't really think of what it would
