00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.569
Now, here's a serious question.

00:04:01.569 --> 00:04:03.659
Is it possible?

00:04:03.659 --> 00:04:11.599
That Republicans like Lindsay and others don't
know what context means, so when they say

00:04:11.599 --> 00:04:17.609
